# iOS Architectures & SOLID Principles

- **Single Responsibility (SRP)**: View is pure presentation; business logic lives in UseCases/Interactors.
- **Dependency Inversion (DIP)**: Inject protocol abstractions rather than concrete singletons (`APIClient.shared`).
- Support clean separation for **MVVM**, **Clean Architecture**, and **VIPER**.
- Write unit tests using modern Apple `Swift Testing` (`@Suite`, `@Test`, `#expect`) instead of `XCTestCase`.
